A||||6||Leadfoot||Cold start injector o-ring part number||||1||
Z||000000||Leadfoot||09-11-2001||12:13 AM||||This is just and FYI post.  For those of you rebuilding your 2.8 a common item which is often missing from the gasket rebuild kits is the cold start o-ring kit.  I tried getting this throught the dealer and as I mentioned before the part number listed was shared by two other kits.  If you need to get these o-rings go to <A HREF="http://www.carparts.com" TARGET=_blank>www.carparts.com</A>  and order part number (acd# 17111954).  This is the AC delco part number.  The package also says it is the gm#.||||reg||1
